        "abstract": "Magnetic logic systems provide two outstanding advantages over semiconductor logic systems. They are a parts savings of eighty per cent and an improvement in reliability due to the use of the ultrareliable magnetic devices. These two advantages alone make the application of magnetic logic techniques to machine control very desirable. In addition, machine control affords a low speed application wherein magnetic logic operates optimally.",
